        <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/geo-commodities/feldspar-gemstone> ,
        <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/geo-commodities/gemstone> ;
    skos:broader :mineral-commodities ;
    skos:definition "An apple-green, bright green or blue-green variety of K-feldspar (usually microcline but sometimes applied to orthoclase) with the chemical formula of K(AlSi₃O₈). Amazonite is sometimes used as a gemstone."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch
