    skos:definition "Cerium oxide is a pale yellow-white powder with the chemical formula CeO₂. It is an important commercial product and an intermediate in the purification of the element from the principal ores, bastnäesite and monazite. Cerium oxide is used for polishing and for decolourizing glass."@en ;
