        <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/geo-commodities/clay> ;
    skos:broader :clay ;
    skos:definition "A magnesium-rich clay typically derived from the alteration/weathering of ultramafic and high-Mg basaltic rocks (usually greenstones). Typically used in the fertilizer industry."@en ;
    skos:inScheme cs: ;
