    skos:broader :petroleum ;
    skos:definition "Petroleum in its natural liquid state as it emerges from a well, or after passing through a gas-oil separator but before refining or distillation. After refining or distillation, crude oil yields a range of combustible fuels, petrochemicals and lubricants."@en ;
