    skos:broader :rare-earth-oxides ;
    skos:definition "Lanthanum oxide is an inorganic compound with the chemical formula La₂O₃. It is used in some ferroelectric materials, as a component of optical materials, and is a feedstock for certain catalysts, among other uses."@en ;
