    skos:definition "A specimen of the mineral magnetite (Fe²⁺Fe³⁺₂O₄) occurring in a crystalline form, either as octahedral or as rhombic-dodecahedra. Magnetite crystals are often used in jewellery and for ornamental decorative items."@en ;
