:tantalite
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:broader :tantalite-and-columbite ;
    skos:definition "A mineral group with the general formula (Fe,Mn)Ta₂O₆, forming the tantalum end-member of a solid-solution series with columbite, and a significant ore of tantalum. Generally, mangan-dominant members are more abundant in nature. Many specimens called tantalite actually belong to the columbite series or tapiolite series."@en ;
    skos:inScheme cs: ;
    skos:prefLabel "tantalite"@en ;
