    skos:broader :mineral-commodities ;
    skos:definition "A legacy term used for minerals in the tantalite–columbite series which are found in pegmatites, granites, carbonatites and alkaline igneous rocks. It is the commodity contained within tantalite and columbite concentrates produced from mines within Western Australia between the 1940s and 1960s. Currently, usage as a commodity is discouraged."@en ;
