    skos:definition "A variously coloured rhombohedral mineral of the tourmaline group with the chemical formula Na(Al,Li)₃Al₆(BO₃)₃Si₆O₁₈(OH)₄. It forms the end member of a number of solid solution series with other tourmaline-group minerals, and is the principal gem tourmaline."@en ;
