    skos:altLabel "tronite"@en ;
    skos:broader :mineral-commodities ;
    skos:definition "A white, grey or yellow–white monoclinic mineral with the chemical formula Na₃(CO₃)(HCO₃)·2H₂O . It occurs in fibrous or columnar layers and thick beds in saline residues. Trona is a major source of sodium compounds."@en ;
