    skos:definition "Uranium oxide (U₃O₈) is a compound of uranium. It is present as an olive green to black, odorless solid. It is one of the more popular forms of yellowcake and is shipped between mills and refineries in this form. U₃O₈ has potential long-term stability in a geological environment."@en ;
