    skos:definition "Ytterbium oxide is the chemical compound with the formula Yb₂O₃. It is one of the more commonly encountered compounds of ytterbium. Ytterbium oxide is used as a colourant for glasses and enamels, as a dopant for garnet crystals in lasers and in optical fibres."@en ;
