        <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/geo-commodities/magnetite> ;
    skos:broader :magnetite ;
    skos:definition "A specimen of the mineral magnetite (Fe²⁺Fe³⁺₂O₄) collected, preserved and usually curated as part of a mineral collection. Magnetite in massive or crystalline habit is often used as a semiprecious gem in jewellery and for ornamental decorative items."@en ;
    skos:historyNote "Compiled by the Geological Survey of Western Australia." ;
