:manganese
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:broader :mineral-commodities ;
    skos:definition "A chemical element with the symbol Mn and atomic number 25. It is a hard, brittle, silvery metal, found in minerals in combination with iron. Manganese is a transition metal with a multifaceted array of industrial alloy uses, particularly in stainless steels."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch
        <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/CommodityCodeValue/manganese> ,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/commodity-code/manganese> ,
