:spodumene
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:altLabel "triphane"@en ;
    skos:broader :mineral-commodities ;
    skos:definition "A monoclinic mineral of the pyroxene group with the chemical formula LiAlSi₂O₆. It occurs mainly in white to green prismatic lath-like crystals, often of great size, particularly in granitic pegmatite. Spodumene is an important ore and source of lithium, for use in ceramics, mobile phone and batteries (including for automotive applications), medicine, Pyroceram and as a fluxing agent."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch
        <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/CommodityCodeValue/spodumene> ,
