    skos:broader :asbestos ;
    skos:definition """Fibrous-asbestiform minerals of the amphibole supergroup, including:
- actinolite Ca₂(Mg,Fe)₅Si₈O₂₂(OH)₂
- tremolite Ca₂Mg₅Si₈O₂₂(OH)₂
- anthophyllite (Mg,Fe²⁺)₇Si₈O₂(OH)₂
- crocidolite (a fibrous variety of riebeckite) Na₂(Fe²⁺,Mg)₃Fe³⁺₂Si₈O₂₂(OH)₂
- amosite (a fibrous variety of grunerite) (Fe²⁺,Mg)₇Si₈O₂₂(OH)₂"""@en ;
