:felsic-igneous-rock
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:broader :industrial-commodities ;
    skos:definition "An igneous rock composed chiefly of one or more felsic, light-coloured minerals in its mode, i.e. with an abundance of feldspar, feldspathoid and/or quartz."@en ;
    skos:historyNote "Adapted from Glossary of geology, 5th edition revised; Neuendorf et al., 2011" ;
