:industrial-commodities
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:altLabel "basic raw materials"@en ;
    skos:definition "Geological materials, rock products, minerals or mineral groups that are mined for their physical and/or chemical properties, and excluding fuel minerals and those commodities that are sources of metals (metallic minerals). Industrial commodities are used in their natural state or after beneficiation either as raw materials or as additives in a wide range of applications. Minerals listed here are considered bulk rock commodities (e.g. feldspar)."@en ;
